{"id": "DaDX64Oxd67", "title": "Video by glambykalgi", "description": "There is something incredibly beautiful about the moments before a bride walks into her forever.\n\nWrapped in a delicate veil, holding fresh blooms close to her heart, and standing beneath a sky painted in golden hues, she isn't thinking about the camera. She's thinking about the beginning of a whole new chapter.\n\nFor this look, our vision was never to create something loud. Instead, we focused on soft glamour, luminous skin, timeless elegance, and thoughtful details that would never go out of style. Every element was carefully chosen to complement the emotion of the moment rather than overpower it, allowing her natural beauty to remain at the heart of every frame.\n\nBecause when the photographs are revisited years later, we don't just want you to admire the makeup.\n\nWe want you to remember exactly how beautiful you felt in that moment.\n\n✨ If you're dreaming of a bridal look that's timeless, elegant, and uniquely yours, we'd be honoured to be a part of your special day.\n\n💌 DM us to reserve your bridal date.\n\nMakeup: @glambykalgi\nHairstylist: @hairbyvandana_\nIn Frame: @vidhi__mistry\nOutfit: @jayshree_studios\nJewellery: @rajjewellery\nStylist: @niraali.patel\nLocation: @lifeatrepose\nShoot & Edit: @maddy19_96 @thefilmeticstudios @himanshuu__sharma_\nSpecial Thanks: @therana_45\n\nBridal makeup artist, luxury bridal makeup, Indian bride, bridal beauty, bridal look, wedding makeup, bride to be, bridal inspiration, bridal transformation, modern bride, bridal hairstyle, wedding season, Ahmedabad MUA, bridal makeup Ahmedabad, Indian wedding, bridal elegance, soft glam makeup, timeless bride, luxury bride, bridal photoshoot\n\n#AhmedabadMakeupArtist #WeddingGlam #BridesToBe #IndianBrides #BridalLook", "channel": "glambykalgi", "uploader_id": "173648519", "uploader": "Kalgi Vyas", "timestamp": 1782484757, "like_count": 14351, "comment_count": 69, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.in